.gradle/
build/
local.properties
.idea/
*.iml
.kotlin/

# Machine- and household-specific: TV addresses, signing key. Hand over privately.
local/
.DS_Store

# Copied into the website by tools/deploy-site.sh: the latest release's APKs and the install scripts.
site/download/
site/tools/
site/install.sh
site/icons/

# Wrangler state and the account cache (account id, e-mail).
.wrangler/

# Icon/design working files: candidate renders, screenshots, generator scripts.
docs/iconstudy/

# Temporary chunks from Wi-Fi adb transfers to the TV.
chunks/

# docs/ 下的本地草稿：一次性测试截图、烘焙中间产物、旧版备份。这里已经堆了约 1.8 GB，
# 全部只留在本机，不进仓库（进了之后 clone 一次要传半个 G，谁也不想）。
# 只放行真正要交接的文档和图纸；已经跟踪的文件（docs/*.md、docs/brand、docs/devices）
# 不受影响，git 只对「新文件」应用这些规则。
docs/*
!docs/*.md
!docs/brand/
!docs/devices/
